# Vercel Speed Insights Implementation Report

## Summary
Successfully installed and configured Vercel Speed Insights for the HustleGrad React application.

## Changes Made

### 1. Package Installation
- **Installed**: `@vercel/speed-insights` version 2.0.0
- **Package Manager**: npm (package-lock.json updated)
- **File Modified**: `package.json`

### 2. Component Integration
- **File Modified**: `src/App.js`
- **Changes**:
  - Added import: `import { SpeedInsights } from '@vercel/speed-insights/react';`
  - Added `<SpeedInsights />` component inside the `<BrowserRouter>` wrapper, after the `<Routes>` component
  - This placement ensures Speed Insights tracks all route navigation across the application

### 3. Implementation Details
- **Framework**: React 18.3.1 with Create React App (react-scripts 5.0.1)
- **Documentation Source**: Retrieved latest instructions from https://vercel.com/docs/speed-insights/quickstart
- **Implementation Pattern**: Followed React-specific integration as per official Vercel documentation
- **Component Placement**: Added at the app root level to capture metrics from all routes

