## Next Steps for Deployment
To enable Speed Insights in production:
1. Deploy this application to Vercel
2. Navigate to the Speed Insights tab in your Vercel project dashboard
3. Click the "Enable" button to activate Speed Insights
4. After deployment, verify the Speed Insights script is loaded on your pages
5. Metrics will start appearing in your dashboard after users visit your site

## Technical Notes
- The SpeedInsights component is lightweight and only loads in production environments
- It automatically collects Web Vitals metrics (LCP, FID, CLS, FCP, TTFB)
- No additional configuration is required for basic functionality
- The component is framework-aware and optimized for React applications
